Title: Pagebreak for PDF happens in the middle of components

Description:
When rendering summary2 components in the PDF, the components are sometimes positioned between two pages, and are cut in half. We should try to avoid pagebreaks within components, and instead break before or after components.

Maybe we could do something similar to the old summary components where this css is used:
```
@media print {
  .container {
    break-inside: avoid;
  }
}
```

Source: https://github.com/Altinn/app-frontend-react/issues/2432

