Title: Repeating groups in groups

Description:
### Description of the bug

When having a repeating group in a regular group (nested repeating groups not tested), there are multiple issues. The issues stem from the main issue being the disappearance of the "Add new" button, meaning the repeating group doesn't appear at all. Fixed by adding the "openByDefault" attribute. If one now adds the "alwaysShowAddButton" attribute, the page crashes.

### Steps To Reproduce

1. Add a group with a repeating group as child
2. Add the repeating group
3. nothing should appear. Add "openByDefault" and set it to true, first or last.
4. Repeating group should appear. if you now add "alwaysShowAddButton = true", the page crashes

### Additional Information

page layout som kan testes med. Vil feile pga openbydefault og alwaysshowaddbutton

