Title: MultipleSelect laster ikke inn språket når optionlista har kobling til språkfila

Description:
### Description of the bug

Når en opprette en MultipleSelect med kobling til en optionliste som er definert som JSON så laster den ikke inn språket, når elementene i lista linker til språkfila.
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/91887041/194066306-1bfd0b03-2385-4a8c-9a82-162b5eb3c071.png)
dette funker fint hvis man bruker checkboxer:
![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/91887041/194066609-6c3feafb-3419-4a97-9711-c72679813626.png)


### Steps To Reproduce

Opprett en MultipleSelect:
{
        "id": "Side4-Spm2-lknjas87-c032-495d-8cc6-0fbc55ae9d30",
        "type": "MultipleSelect",
        "textResourceBindings": {
          "title": "Velg blant kjente arbeidskonflikter i listen"
        },
        "dataModelBindings": {
          "simpleBinding": "SkjemaData.Hjelpefelter.hjelpefelt1"
        },
        "required": true,
        "optionsId": "JaNei"
      }

Optionliste ser slik ut:
[
    {
      "label": "lang.option.ja",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "label": "lang.option.nei",
      "value": 0
    }
  ]

der teksten ligger i språkfila.
    {
      "id": "lang.option.ja",
      "value": "Ja"
    },
    {
      "id": "lang.option.nei",
      "value": "Nei"
    }

### Additional Information

![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/91887041/194066342-a8bd8702-63d6-4110-80fd-06751139c408.png)
https://github.com/Altinn/app-frontend-react/issues/56
https://github.com/Altinn/app-frontend-react/pull/505

Source: https://github.com/Altinn/app-frontend-react/issues/466

State: CLOSED

Labels: kind/bug, org/dsb

Title: Likert-component does not work inside a non-repeating group

Description:
### Description of the bug

See title.


- Is this also the case for rep-groups inside non-repeating groups?

### Steps To Reproduce

1. Add a formlayout with a non-rep group that contains a likert component definition
2. See that an error message is thrown when running the app.

Error message shown:
`TypeError: Cannot destructure property 'optionsId' of 't[0]' as it is undefined. at t.RepeatingGroupsLikertContainer `

Example minimal formlayout:
```json
{
  "$schema": "https://altinncdn.no/schemas/json/layout/layout.schema.v1.json",
  "data": {
    "layout": [
      {
        "id": "ifMaterialDamageGroup",
        "type": "Group",
        "dataModelBindings": {},
        "children": [
          "descriptionDamage",
          "assumedCost",
          "materialDamageLikert"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "descriptionDamage",
        "type": "TextArea",
        "textResourceBindings": {
          "title": "descriptionDamage"
        },
        "dataModelBindings": {
          "simpleBinding": "MaterialDamage.Description"
        },
        "required": true,
        "readOnly": false
      },
      {
        "id": "assumedCost",
        "type": "RadioButtons",
        "textResourceBindings": {
          "title": "assumedCost"
        },
        "dataModelBindings": {
          "simpleBinding": "MaterialDamage.EstimatedCost"
        },
        "optionsId": "damageCosts",
        "required": true
      },
      {
        "id": "materialDamageLikert",
        "type": "Group",
        "textResourceBindings": {
          "title": "materialDamage"
        },
        "maxCount": 3,
        "children": [
          "likert-row"
        ],
        "dataModelBindings": {
          "group": "MaterialDamage.DamageTypes"
        },
        "edit": {
          "mode": "likert"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "likert-row",
        "type": "Likert",
        "textResourceBindings": {
          "title": "likert-row-title"
        },
        "dataModelBindings": {
          "simpleBinding": "MaterialDamage.DamageTypes.Answer"
        },
        "optionsId": "damageTypes",
        "required": false,
        "readOnly": false
      },
    ]
  }
}
```

Issue was reported by dsb on [slack](https://altinn.slack.com/archives/C03DX42K6AY/p1663063027425429), and app is setup and failing at [this commit](https://altinn.studio/repos/dsb/uhell-med-fyrverkeri/src/commit/e194737fa3d78b73b7869b596980e916dc18b400/App/ui/layouts/MaterialDamage.json#L60). 

